{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":11,"ref":"genesis 32:11","book":"genesis","lang":"de","chapter":32,"translation":"Ich bin zu gering für all die Chessed-Taten und für all die Emet, die du an deinem Knecht getan hast — ⟨denn⟩ mit meinem Stecken bin ich über diesen Jardén gegangen, und jetzt bin ich zu zwei Lagern geworden.","tokens":[{"surface":"קטנתי","gloss":"ich bin zu gering"},{"surface":"מכל","gloss":"für alle"},{"surface":"החסדים","gloss":"die Chessed-Taten"},{"surface":"ומכל","gloss":"und für alle"},{"surface":"האמת","gloss":"die Emet"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"die"},{"surface":"עשית","gloss":"du getan hast"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"deinen Knecht"},{"surface":"עבדך","gloss":"an deinem Knecht"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"⟨denn⟩"},{"surface":"במקלי","gloss":"mit meinem Stecken"},{"surface":"עברתי","gloss":"bin ich gegangen"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"den Jardén"},{"surface":"הירדן","gloss":"über diesen Jardén"},{"surface":"הזה","gloss":"diesen"},{"surface":"ועתה","gloss":"und jetzt"},{"surface":"הייתי","gloss":"bin ich geworden"},{"surface":"לשני","gloss":"zu zwei"},{"surface":"מחנות","gloss":"Lagern"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T00:09:31.019497150Z","model":"glm-5.2"}